<title>POLAND: Polish Lentex carpet maker to enter bourse May 8.</title>
<headline>Polish Lentex carpet maker to enter bourse May 8.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish carpet maker Lentex SA will start trade on the Warsaw bourse's main market on May 8, the president of the bourse said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The first listing of Lentex SA will take place on the bourse's session on May 8,&quot; Wieslaw Rozlucki said after the bourse session.</p>
<p>Lentex's February 1.5-million-share initial public offering priced 21.5 zlotys per share was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
